      "title": "#5 细节追踪"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "806001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "苍岚，我们找你找了半天，你有没有看到真恋的小兔音箱？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "苍岚",
          "text": "……没有。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806003",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你撒谎！那是什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "苍岚",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "证据确凿，无话可说了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "苍岚",
          "text": "我不会把音箱交给你们的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "……为什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "苍岚",
          "text": "因为……我讨厌公主殿下回到人类的身边。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806009",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你说什么？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "苍岚",
          "text": "公主殿下只能永远被我守护，这是骑士和公主的誓约。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "真是莫名其妙的家伙，我早就想告诉你了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "我们都是生活在人类城市中的手办，这个世界根本没有你想的那些东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "没有所谓的骑士，也没有所谓的公主。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "你不是骑士，真恋也不是公主！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "苍岚",
          "text": "这不可能，我不相信……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "806016",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "那我就用我的方式让你相信！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
